Trello

It's here: Dark Mode in Trello 
 
Give your Trello boards a fresh new look with new dark and light color themes to illuminate your productivity in any brightness of your choosing.
 
Color me intrigued 
>> https://blog.trello.com/introducing-trello-dark-mode?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-june2023-newsletter1_EML-15903&jobid=106107271&subid=1751586021&send_date=6/22/2023
 
 
Clean up bad decision‑making hygiene with these easy steps
 
Ever feel like important decisions are being made in ad hoc meetings and siloed conversations? You're not alone. Get your decision‑making process in check with these async practices. 
 
Make better decisions
>> https://blog.trello.com/async-practices-for-decision-making?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-june2023-newsletter1_EML-15903&jobid=106107271&subid=1751586021&send_date=6/22/2023
 
 
This is how you pull off seamless onboarding 
 
Whether you're onboarding onto a new team or project, bringing a newbie is always overwhelming. Luckily, Trello and Confluence make onboarding a breeze for everybody involved.
 
Get on board
>> https://blog.trello.com/effective-onboarding-with-confluence-and-trello?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-june2023-newsletter1_EML-15903&jobid=106107271&subid=1751586021&send_date=6/22/2023
 
 
Here's how to knock your next project out of the park
 
Successful projects take organization, collaboration, alignment, and a strong team. You've got the right people, so let us help you with the rest.
 
Get it done
>> https://blog.trello.com/trello-and-confluence-together-for-project-management?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-june2023-newsletter1_EML-15903&jobid=106107271&subid=1751586021&send_date=6/22/2023
 
 
Introducing Atlassian Together
 
Alone we can do so little; together we can do so much. It's time to unblock wall‑to‑wall teamwork with Atlassian Together.
 
Learn more
>> https://www.atlassian.com/blog/announcements/atlassian-together-available-today?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-june2023-newsletter1_EML-15903&jobid=106107271&subid=1751586021&send_date=6/22/2023
 
